"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":25},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"BEAT COP: Immigrated a decade ago? Became a citizen awful fast.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":32.96,"end":37.152,"frac":0.818,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":11},"large":{"start":32.96,"end":37.152,"frac":0.818,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":11},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"CYE: I’m sure he studied hard. Family? Workplace?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":37.632,"end":40.352,"frac":0.875,"status":"ok","matched":7,"words":8},"large":{"start":37.632,"end":40.352,"frac":0.875,"status":"ok","matched":7,"words":8},"differ":false},{"i":8,"text":"BEAT COP: File says one sibling, Orothea , aaaand some local café. The “Pick-You-Up”.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":40.832,"end":48.064,"frac":0.733,"status":"ok","matched":11,"words":15},"large":{"start":40.832,"end":48.064,"frac":0.733,"status":"ok","matched":11,"words":15},"differ":false},{"i":9,"text":"CYE: Classic storefront for the unlicensed. Where is it?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":48.64,"end":51.328,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":9},"large":{"start":48.64,"end":51.328,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":9},"differ":false},{"i":10,"text":"BEAT COP: Down by Portal Park.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":51.808,"end":52.992,"frac":0.667,"status":"ok","matched":4,"words":6},"large":{"start":51.808,"end":52.992,"frac":0.667,"status":"ok","matched":4,"words":6},"differ":false},{"i":11,"text":"CYE: Let’s call it by its name, shall we?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":53.472,"end":55.48,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":9},"large":{"start":53.472,"end":55.584,"frac":0.889,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":9},"differ":false},{"i":12,"text":"BEAT COP: Oh, you’re one of those . Fine, Park Pailte. Bad neighbourhood.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":56.096,"end":63.4,"frac":0.833,"status":"ok","matched":10,"words":12},"large":{"start":56.096,"end":63.24,"frac":0.75,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":12},"differ":false},{"i":13,"text":"CYE: If by ‘bad’ you mean ‘structurally underserved’ –","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":63.4,"end":66.784,"frac":0.875,"status":"ok","matched":7,"words":8},"large":{"start":63.24,"end":66.784,"frac":0.875,"status":"ok","matched":7,"words":8},"differ":false},{"i":14,"text":"BEAT COP: Nope. Not gonna hear it. Bad people making bad choices down there. No wonder the protestors are flocking there like flies. Spirits and fae are part of it for sure, attachin’ to the vulnerable – don’t talk to me like I don’t use my eyes.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":67.168,"end":82.28,"frac":0.935,"status":"ok","matched":43,"words":46},"large":{"start":67.168,"end":82.5,"frac":0.935,"status":"ok","matched":43,"words":46},"differ":false},{"i":15,"text":"CYE: I simply mean it is poorly maintained and laid-out. Had to adjust its population quickly post-Severing. Reports trending in a downward direction – well, some things going up. Like violence. And smoke from un-flame-retardant construction materials.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":82.752,"end":97.472,"frac":0.95,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":40},"large":{"start":82.752,"end":97.472,"frac":0.95,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":40},"differ":false},{"i":16,"text":"BEAT COP: You should take a walk down there. Lots you can’t learn from a report. They’re not meant to be here.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":98.464,"end":105.184,"frac":0.864,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":22},"large":{"start":98.464,"end":105.184,"frac":0.909,"status":"ok","matched":20,"words":22},"differ":false},{"i":17,"text":"CYE: War rarely respects what’s ‘meant to be’.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":105.376,"end":108.24,"frac":0.875,"status":"ok","matched":7,"words":8},"large":{"start":105.376,"end":108.448,"frac":0.875,"status":"ok","matched":7,"words":8},"differ":false},{"i":18,"text":"CORONER: Gentlemen. He might have lived down by the Park, but he died here. He was going somewhere.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":109.12,"end":116.16,"frac":0.944,"status":"ok","matched":17,"words":18},"large":{"start":109.12,"end":116.16,"frac":0.944,"status":"ok","matched":17,"words":18},"differ":false},{"i":19,"text":"CYE: And it will take some time to trace his previous movements in the transit record. Hmm.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":116.864,"end":120.32,"frac":0.882,"status":"ok","matched":15,"words":17},"large":{"start":116.864,"end":120.9,"frac":0.941,"status":"ok","matched":16,"words":17},"differ":true},{"i":20,"text":"NARRATOR: A sudden chill washes over the three of them.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":120.8,"end":125.088,"frac":0.9,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":10},"large":{"start":121.952,"end":125.088,"frac":0.9,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":10},"differ":true},{"i":21,"text":"CYE: Anything unusual about his wounds?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":125.696,"end":127.56,"frac":0.833,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":6},"large":{"start":125.696,"end":127.48,"frac":0.833,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":6},"differ":false},{"i":22,"text":"CORONER: Nothing at all. Hit at speed, dead on impact. Least he wasn’t dragged.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":127.56,"end":132.448,"frac":0.929,"status":"ok","matched":13,"words":14},"large":{"start":127.48,"end":132.448,"frac":0.929,"status":"ok","matched":13,"words":14},"differ":false},{"i":23,"text":"BEAT COP: Open and shut suicide. It’s an epidemic with the seers these days. Probably the guilt finally getting to them after all these years.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":133.472,"end":141.42,"frac":0.92,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":25},"large":{"start":133.472,"end":141.2,"frac":0.92,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":25},"differ":false},{"i":24,"text":"NARRATOR: Cye ignores the beat cop’s rhetoric, parroted from so many bigoted aircasts. Instead, he’s tracing the yarn back in his head, unlooping the next knot, spinning out strands into new theories. He is, as Martine says, a little too thorough for common sense.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":141.472,"end":160.736,"frac":0.955,"status":"ok","matched":42,"words":44},"large":{"start":141.472,"end":160.736,"frac":0.955,"status":"ok","matched":42,"words":44},"differ":false},{"i":25,"text":"CYE: I’ll notify the workplace first, see where this crack in the foundation started. I can copy the final report to your office, if you’d like.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":161.28,"end":167.616,"frac":0.962,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":26},"large":{"start":161.28,"end":167.616,"frac":0.962,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":26},"differ":false},{"i":26,"text":"CORONER: Not everybody remembers to do that. Sometimes you see a body, sign it off…","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":168.32,"end":174.144,"frac":0.933,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":15},"large":{"start":168.32,"end":174.14,"frac":0.933,"status":"ok","matched":14,"words":15},"differ":false},{"i":27,"text":"CYE: And it may as well disappear. A little too quickly, a little too easily. It matters that we follow these things through.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":174.624,"end":181.536,"frac":0.957,"status":"ok","matched":22,"words":23},"large":{"start":174.624,"end":181.536,"frac":0.957,"status":"ok","matched":22,"words":23},"differ":false},{"i":28,"text":"NARRATOR: Cye hopes that attention to detail will serve him well as he heads to the victim’s workplace, the Pick-You-Up Café.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":182.336,"end":189.6,"frac":0.87,"status":"ok","matched":20,"words":23},"large":{"start":182.336,"end":189.6,"frac":0.87,"status":"ok","matched":20,"words":23},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/6ab6dc4226474_5-2b.jpg"}